warning[manual_clamp]: `x` is kept between `0` and `100` by hand
  --> tests/lint/manual_clamp/bad.jai:13:5
   |
13 |     if x < 0 {
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `clamp(x, 0, 100)`
   |
13 -     if x < 0 {
14 -         x = 0;
15 -     } else if x > 100 {
16 -         x = 100;
17 -     }
13 +     x = clamp(x, 0, 100);
   |
   = note: `manual_clamp` is `warn` by default

warning[manual_clamp]: `x` is kept between `0` and `LIMIT` by hand
  --> tests/lint/manual_clamp/bad.jai:19:5
   |
19 |     if x > LIMIT x = LIMIT;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `clamp(x, 0, LIMIT)`
   |
19 -     if x > LIMIT x = LIMIT;
20 -     else if x <= 0 x = 0;
19 +     x = clamp(x, 0, LIMIT);
   |
   = note: `manual_clamp` is `warn` by default

warning[manual_clamp]: `x` is kept between `0` and `255` by hand
  --> tests/lint/manual_clamp/bad.jai:22:10
   |
22 |     e := ifx x < 0 then 0 else ifx x > 255 then 255 else x;
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `clamp(x, 0, 255)`
   |
22 ~     e := clamp(x, 0, 255);
   |
   = note: `manual_clamp` is `warn` by default

warning[manual_clamp]: `f` is kept between `0.0` and `1.0` by hand
  --> tests/lint/manual_clamp/bad.jai:23:10
   |
23 |     g := ifx f > 1.0 then 1.0 else ifx f < 0.0 then 0.0 else f;
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
